  "title": "Distortions in Judged Spatial Relations",
  "authors": "Albert Stevens and Patty Coupe, 1978",
  "research_question": "To what extent do distortions occur in subjects' judgments of relative geographical relations, particularly when locations are in different geographical or political units, and what underlying representation and inference processes account for these distortions?",
