  "limitations": [
    "The experiments primarily focused on direction judgments, and further research is needed to explore other types of spatial relations.",
    "The specific types of spatial relations (e.g., landmarks, geometrical features) that hold between units were not fully explored.",
    "The study induced subjects to use political units; different task demands might induce different organizational structures and inference mechanisms."
